00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:40,600
If it is not stable, please increase the tail shrink rate to 80%, then 90%, and finally 100%

247
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:43,600
Now we will start making the nurse hat

248
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:48,600
Now we will start making the nurse hat

249
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:58,600
Add the Nurse Hat file we provided to the work area

250
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:07,599
Use the fold arrangement tool to fold the hat along the inner line position

251
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:11,599
Then move the folded panel to the head area

252
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:27,599
When the panel is close to the virtual model head, press the W key to add a pin on the panel and fix it in 3D space

253
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:31,599
Then print the panel to make the fold more intense

254
00:17:31,599 --> 00:17:37,599
Activate simulation

255
00:17:37,599 --> 00:17:42,599
Now the panel has fallen to the head, we will use the pin to fold the back of the nurse hat

256
00:17:43,599 --> 00:17:49,599
Press the W key to click on the two corners of the panel to add a pin

257
00:17:49,599 --> 00:17:54,599
Then open the simulation, move the pin to fold the back of the hat

258
00:17:54,599 --> 00:18:00,599
Try to get these two corners as close to the head as possible

259
00:18:00,599 --> 00:18:07,599
Please make sure that one corner is very flat on the other corner

260
00:18:07,599 --> 00:18:11,599
Then press the W key to click on the pin to delete them

261
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:23,600
Then create a sewing line between these two internal lines

262
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:28,600
Please check the 3D window to confirm that the sewing line direction is matching

263
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:34,600
Add a pin to the corner at the bottom to fix this corner, then start to simulate

264
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:41,600
After opening the simulation, move the pin to continue it close to the model head

265
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:51,600
Then reduce the粒子間距到10,衝突厚度降低到1並模擬一下

266
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:58,600
Then use the folding arrangement tool to fold down the top panel of the hat

267
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:02,600
Then use the folding arrangement tool to fold down the top panel of the hat

268
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:05,600
Then use the folding arrangement tool to fold down the top panel of the hat

269
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:10,600
And drag the panel to keep it straight

270
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:20,600
Change the movement tool to select the On key, then delete the pin

271
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:25,600
Turn the pin to the back and place it close to the panel of the head

272
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:28,600
And then select to fix it to the virtual model

273
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:32,600
The last pin is fixed to the virtual model

274
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:33,600
Then when you simulate

275
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:37,100
you will find that the hat is already fixed on the virtual model's head.

276
00:19:37,100 --> 00:19:40,100
Now the hat will not fall off easily.

277
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:45,600
Use the same method to fix it to the side of the nurse hat.

278
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:48,100
When you fix the pin to the virtual model,

279
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:51,100
it will automatically fix it to the recent virtual model grid peak.

280
00:19:51,100 --> 00:19:54,600
Using this method can help us make the hat more suitable for the virtual model.

281
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:58,100
Open the simulation, drag the hat board and adjust the balance of the hat.

282
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:02,100
Then remove the hardening of the board.

283
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:07,100
Check the physical properties of the fabric used for the hat.

284
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:10,100
You will find that the curve of this hat is very high.

285
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:13,100
This is because we can still see that it is harder after hardening,

286
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:16,100
which supports the whole hat.

287
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:23,100
Now let's adjust the physical properties of the skirt.

288
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:25,100
Unlock the shirt skirt.

289
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:30,100
Replace the thick texture surface.

290
00:20:30,100 --> 00:20:33,100
Select all the sheets that form the shirt skirt.

291
00:20:33,100 --> 00:20:36,600
Click on the application of the fabric window to apply a new fabric for them.

292
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:38,600
Then go to the property editor.

293
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:40,600
Select a pre-set fabric for this fabric.

294
00:20:40,600 --> 00:20:42,600
Here I choose cotton tulle.

295
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:45,600
This is a fabric suitable for working clothes and sweaters.

296
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:47,600
Open the simulation.

297
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,600
You will see that because this fabric is not easy to stretch,

298
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:52,600
the creases are easier to produce and become more obvious.

299
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:56,600
Then use the editor tool to select the sewing line.

300
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:58,600
Open the sewing line in the property editor.

301
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:00,600
Since this side is stacked with an easy-to-stretch sewing line,

302
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:02,600
the creases on the other side will be more obvious.

303
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:05,600
You will see theื

304
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:09,600
Then open the ease called the продолжating sewing line.

305
00:21:09,600 --> 00:21:14,600
Next we unlock the skirt and iron all the clothes together.

306
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:18,600
Here there are 3 places where you can unlock the skirt.

307
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:20,600
You can match them according to the rolling board.

308
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:22,600
Here they are one and the same.

309
00:21:22,600 --> 00:21:24,600
Then we can unlock both feet.

310
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:26,600
Here are 3 places where you can unlock the skirt and iron.

311
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:28,600
Here are 3 places where you can unlock both feet.

312
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:30,600
Here are 3 places where you can unlock both feet.

313
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:33,600
You can also reduce the conflict thickness and the strength of the particles.

314
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:55,600
After the simulation is complete, delete the excess collar fold line and simulate again.

315
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:06,600
Next, we can reduce the particle diameter of the shirt skirt to 5 to get more detailed clothing details.

316
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:23,600
Then delete the fold line on the sleeve and simulate to get a more natural fold effect.

317
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:27,600
